 "formula": "P1.1 - Extract the learned adjacency from the Adaptive-LSTGAN PeMS-BAY checkpoints.\n\nGraph learner (verbatim formula from notebooks/LSTGAN_Seed_Sweep.ipynb, cell 6, which trained the checkpoints):\n    S   = E_src E_tgt^T / sqrt(d)\n    A_k = rownorm( softmax_row( topk_mask(S, k) ) * (1 - I) )      # form (b): what the model propagates over\n    A_d = rownorm( softmax_row( S ) * (1 - I) )                     # form (a): same without the top-k mask\nFusion in the model is on Laplacians: L = s*L_static + (1-s)*L_learned with s = sigmoid(alpha_logit);\nthe weight on the learned graph is alpha = 1 - s (CLAUDE.md convention). The fused operator is a Laplacian,\nnot an adjacency, so it is not saved as a communication graph; alpha is recorded in the provenance file.",
